message: "If you use this software or the accompanying audit, please cite it as below. Citation information is provisional pending formal publication."
title: "Deers Rock — Deterministic Healthcare Microsimulation (Reopening Audit Artifact)"
abstract: >-
  A standalone, deterministic micro-scale healthcare simulation (1 tick = 1 minute,
  1440 ticks = 1 day) designed to function as an independent sentinel within a
  macro-scale world simulation through an explicit adapter boundary. This release
  accompanies a formal reopening audit establishing: cross-process determinism
  (byte-identical full-state for fixed seeds), per-sentinel seeded RNG via
  worldSeed ^ (hospitalId * 2654435761) >>> 0, sentinel independence with
  perturbation isolation, and boundary isolation from world state. The audit
  demonstrates that the documented macro-to-micro and micro-to-macro coupling
  channels are, in the current implementation, respectively inert and dead, and
  reports the committed COVID-19 counterfactual as an honest negative result
  (unreproducible; its flagged effects are statistical artifacts).
authors:
